tps://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/101008","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101008","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101008.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101008.patch","merged_at":"2025-01-16T23:24:28Z"},"body":"Turns out, reading files in the cache becomes prohibitively slow once it achieves moderate size. Instead of attempting to optimize what was already a bandage solution, this tackles the root issue of text files being incorrectly cached. `NoCache` was never properly applied to several builders, most notably *all* `.glsl.gen.h` files, so this sweeps through and ensures they're actually enforced. Consequently, the dedicated text cache check has been entirely discarded; there's no reasonable situation where that will occur anymore, and the performance hit isn't worth it in the first place.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101008/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocke